@startuml GetConnection-Three-Layer-Architecture

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho

title getConnection() 三层协作架构 - 原理与灵活性

package "业务代码层" #FFFDE7 {
    component [业务调用\n需求: 获取数据库连接] as Business
}

package "SPI 契约层\ndolphinscheduler-spi" #E3F2FD {
    component [DataSourceClient\ngetConnection()\nclose()] as IClient
    component [AdHocDataSourceClient\n临时连接接口] as IAdHoc
    component [PooledDataSourceClient\n池化连接接口] as IPooled
    component [DataSourceChannelFactory\ncreate()] as IFactory
}

package "API 实现层\ndolphinscheduler-datasource-api" #FFF3E0 {
    component [DataSourceClientProvider\ngetPooledConnection()\ngetAdHocConnection()] as Provider
    component [BaseAdHocDataSourceClient\ngetConnection()\n直接创建新连接] as BaseAdHoc
    component [BasePooledDataSourceClient\ngetConnection()\n从连接池获取] as BasePooled
    component [DataSourceProcessor\ngetConnection(params)\ngetJdbcUrl()\ngetDriver()] as IProcessor
}

package "插件实现层\ndolphinscheduler-datasource-*" #E8F5E9 {
    component [MySQLDataSourceProcessor\ngetConnection()\nDriver: com.mysql.cj.jdbc.Driver\nValidation: SELECT 1] as MySQLProc
    component [PostgreSQLDataSourceProcessor\ngetConnection()\nDriver: org.postgresql.Driver] as PGProc
    component [OracleDataSourceProcessor\ngetConnection()\nValidation: SELECT 1 FROM DUAL] as OracleProc
    component [其他 25 种数据源] as Others
}

component [java.sql.Connection\n最终目标] as FinalConn #F48FB1

' AdHoc 路径
Business -[#FF6B6B,bold]down-> Provider : 1.getAdHocConnection()
Provider -[#FF6B6B,bold]down-> BaseAdHoc : 2.创建AdHoc客户端
BaseAdHoc -[#FF6B6B,bold]right-> IProcessor : 3.调用getConnection()
IProcessor -[#FF6B6B,bold]down-> MySQLProc : 4.适配MySQL
MySQLProc -[#FF6B6B,bold]down-> FinalConn : 5.返回新连接

' Pooled 路径
Business -[#4CAF50,bold]down-> Provider : 1.getPooledConnection()
Provider -[#4CAF50,bold]down-> BasePooled : 2.创建Pooled客户端
BasePooled -[#4CAF50,dotted]right-> IProcessor : 3.初始化时调用
BasePooled -[#4CAF50,bold]down-> FinalConn : 4.返回池化连接

' SPI 契约
IClient <|-- IAdHoc
IClient <|-- IPooled
IAdHoc <|.. BaseAdHoc
IPooled <|.. BasePooled
IFactory -up-> IClient

' Processor 实现
IProcessor <|.. MySQLProc
IProcessor <|.. PGProc
IProcessor <|.. OracleProc
IProcessor <|.. Others

FinalConn -[#2196F3,bold]up-> Business : 6.业务使用

note right of IClient
  SPI 层职责
  ============
  定义契约 (What)
  - 定义接口规范
  - 不关心实现细节
  - 支持多种实现
  
  核心接口:
  DataSourceClient
    getConnection() 核心方法
    close()
  
  扩展点:
  DataSourceChannelFactory
    每个数据源提供一个实现
end note

note right of Provider
  API 层职责
  ============
  提供实现 (How)
  - 实现连接策略
  - 管理连接生命周期
  - 提供统一入口
  
  两种策略:
  AdHoc: 临时连接
    不使用连接池
    每次创建新连接
    适合低频场景
  
  Pooled: 池化连接
    使用 HikariCP
    连接复用
    适合高频场景
  
  核心抽象:
  DataSourceProcessor
    适配不同数据库
end note

note right of MySQLProc
  插件层职责
  ============
  具体适配 (Adapt)
  - 实现特定数据库逻辑
  - 适配数据库差异
  - 可插拔扩展
  
  每个数据源提供:
  DataSourceProcessor 实现
    getConnection()
    getJdbcUrl()
    getDatasourceDriver()
    getValidationQuery()
  
  灵活性:
  新增数据源只需实现接口
  通过 @AutoService 注册
  无需修改核心代码
end note

note bottom of FinalConn
  getConnection() 实现路径
  =========================
  
  路径 1: AdHoc 临时连接
  AdHocClient.getConnection()
    -> Processor.getConnection(params)
      -> DriverManager.getConnection()
        -> 返回新连接
  
  路径 2: Pooled 池化连接
  PooledClient.getConnection()
    -> HikariDataSource.getConnection()
      -> pool 中获取/创建连接
        -> 返回池化连接
  
  关键区别:
  AdHoc: 每次调用 Processor
  Pooled: 只在初始化时调用 Processor
end note

legend right
  |= 符号 |= 说明 |
  | 红色箭头 | AdHoc 临时连接路径 |
  | 绿色箭头 | Pooled 池化连接路径 |
  | 蓝色箭头 | 返回给业务使用 |
  | 虚线箭头 | 初始化时调用 |
  
  架构灵活性体现:
  1. 三层分离 (SPI/API/Plugin)
  2. 策略可选 (AdHoc/Pooled)
  3. 数据源可插拔 (28种)
  4. 实现可定制 (优先级机制)
  5. 连接池可配置 (HikariCP)
endlegend

@enduml
